Comment: The bundled UbuntuOrigWeight fonts are under the Ubuntu Font
 Licence 1.0, which is not DFSG-free (#1151346), so the fonts directory
 is removed from the upstream tarball. The bundled Noto Sans Math (OFL)
 is removed along with it, as it is available in fonts-noto-core.

